flowchart TD
    A["Plugin ZIP / WP catalog / Composer"] --> B["Download + checksum/provenance verification"]
    B --> C["Static scan: SQL, DDL, IDs, hooks, direct drivers"]
    C --> D{"Known compatible version?"}
    D -- No --> E["Manifest candidate + evidence"]
    D -- Yes --> F["Load reviewed adapter + lock hash"]
    E --> G["Ephemeral sandbox: activate + migrate + exercise API"]
    F --> G
    G --> H{"UUID, SQL and behavior pass?"}
    H -- No --> X["BLOCK / quarantine; report remediation"]
    H -- Yes --> I["Human/CI approval + immutable plan"]
    I --> J["Backup + migration lock + apply PG changes"]
    J --> K{"Migration checks pass?"}
    K -- No --> X
    K -- Yes --> L["Activate on managed runtime"]
    L --> M["Post-activation verification + monitoring"]
